Package: labwc-layout-indicator
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: labwc
Description: keyboard layout indicator for the labwc system tray
 Shows the active keyboard layout as a coloured badge (EN, SR, СР, DE, ...)
 in any StatusNotifierItem tray, such as wf-panel-pi on Raspberry Pi OS.
 Left click switches to the next layout, right click to the previous one and
 middle click back to the first. Every standard xkb layout has its own label
 and a colour taken from its flag.
